{"id":"n16747-1-7","stage":2,"title":"삼키다 · 咽","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16747-1-7-1","ko":"급하게 먹지 말고 음식을 꼭꼭 씹어 삼켜라.","zh":"别着急吃，要把食物仔细嚼碎再咽下去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"급하게","meaning":"急忙，急切，急促","explanation":"급하다：急忙，急切，急促；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"급하다","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86862","senseId":"2","lemma":"급하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"급하게","audio":"/audio/cf24bba2f542d174a4d0.mp3"}},{"text":"먹지","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹지","audio":"/audio/459814465f88e153b13c.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말고","audio":"/audio/1473c8e39b00e08bbd22.mp3"}},{"text":"음식을","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식을","audio":"/audio/9ea9d415f3b4255ca9e5.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭꼭","meaning":"使劲儿地","explanation":"꼭꼭：使劲儿地","readings":[{"term":"꼭꼭","audio":"/audio/d1b41e6e01c67284b8de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38155","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭꼭","audio":"/audio/d1b41e6e01c67284b8de.mp3"}},{"text":"씹어","meaning":"咀嚼，嚼","explanation":"씹다：咀嚼，嚼；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"씹다","audio":"/audio/145330c56dbb5aee643b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65972","senseId":"1","lemma":"씹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씹어","audio":"/audio/dda6c30a795f15a1a40b.mp3"}},{"text":"삼켜라.","meaning":"咽，吞下","explanation":"삼키다：咽，吞下；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"삼키다","audio":"/audio/f284493d7a89b53f118b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16747","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"삼켜라","audio":"/audio/7f1042996437e012b849.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5c52cd24e00b6dba","term":"급하다","zh":"急忙，急切，急促","audio":"/audio/5c52cd24e00b6dba18be.mp3","entryId":"86862","definition":"做事匆促，没有闲暇。","pronunciation":["그파다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"饮食，饭菜","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"饭、汤等人们每顿食用的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"d1b41e6e01c67284","term":"꼭꼭","zh":"使劲儿地","audio":"/audio/d1b41e6e01c67284b8de.mp3","entryId":"38155","definition":"连续用力地摁或握的样子。","pronunciation":["꼭꼭"]},{"id":"145330c56dbb5aee","term":"씹다","zh":"咀嚼，嚼","audio":"/audio/145330c56dbb5aee643b.mp3","entryId":"65972","definition":"人或动物将食物放在嘴里，用牙齿咬碎或轻柔地磨碎。","pronunciation":["씹따"]},{"id":"f284493d7a89b53f","term":"삼키다","zh":"咽，吞下","audio":"/audio/f284493d7a89b53f118b.mp3","entryId":"16747","definition":"将某物放进嘴里后使其从嗓子眼落下去。","pronunciation":["삼키다"]}],"audio":"/audio/eeac30343abd072876ac.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16747-1-7-2","ko":"네, 알았어요.","zh":"好的，我知道了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"알았어요.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았어요","audio":"/audio/28e47be172aa4e08a4af.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/14aba12461957e98bb9a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.813,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16747","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4106,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好的，我知道了。","我没办法快点把头发吹干。","别着急吃，要把食物仔细嚼碎再咽下去。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好的，我知道了。","别着急吃，要把食物仔细嚼碎再咽下去。","我没办法快点把头发吹干。"],"answer":0}]}
